<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Xircom cut to hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Xircom cut to hold.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Tucker Anthony Inc said it downgraded Xircom Inc to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- After the market closed Monday, Xircom posted second quarter operating earnings of $0.22 a share on net sales of $57.1 million, compared to earnings of $0.06 a share on net sales of $39.9 million last year.</p>
<p>-- Xircom also said it planned to divest its remote-access subsidiary, Netaccess Inc.</p>
<p>-- Xircom lost 3-1/2 to 11-7/8.</p>
</text>
